#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_model.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_model.rst:9
msgid ""
"DaoAI World模型节点用于运行在DaoAI "
"World平台训练的AI模型，支持多种类型的计算机视觉任务。通过该节点，您可以对图像或视频帧进行目标检测、分类、分割、关键点检测、OCR等推理操作。"
msgstr ""
"The DaoAI World model node is used to run AI models trained on the DaoAI "
"World platform and supports multiple types of computer vision tasks.Through "
"this node, you can perform inference operations such as target detection, "
"classification, segmentation, key point detection, and OCR on images or "
"video frames."

