msgstr "**Input**: Image (from upstream node or workflow input)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/models/daoai_world_model.rst:15
msgid "**输出**：根据模型类型不同，输出检测框、分类结果、分割掩码、关键点坐标或文字识别结果等"
msgstr ""
"**Output**: Depending on the model type, output detection frames, "
"classification results, segmentation masks, key point coordinates or text "
"recognition results, etc."

